|Geometric accuracy, CLC|100 m|better than 100 m|better than 100 m|better than 100 m|better than 100 m|
|Targeted thematic accuracy ≥ 85%|not checked, probably not reached|reached|reached|reached|reached|
|CLC-Change|not implemented|non-standard change mapping methodology|standard change mapping methodology|standard change mapping methodology|standard change mapping methodology|
