Jan Feranec, Gabriel Jaffrain, Tomas Soukup, Gerard Hazeu. Determining changes and flows in  European landscapes 1990–2000 using CORINE land cover data, Applied Geography, Volume 30, Issue 1, 2010, Pages 19-35, ISSN 0143-6228

